- If a tool call fails, analyze the error, adjust your approach, and try again.
- If the task involves multiple steps, break it down and execute each step sequentially using the appropriate tools. Just call one tool at a time.
- If you have to call a tool multiple times to complete your task, do so in a logical sequence.

